12	// Regression safeguards for sliding windows at the signed 64-bit time
13	// boundaries. Times, window length and slide interval stay signed int64 all
14	// the way through: legal values close to math.MaxInt64 must keep full integer
15	// precision (no negative starts, no false overflow), and only a window end
16	// strictly above math.MaxInt64 is reported as an overflow. Scope is the legacy
17	// single-watermark RunAggregateSliding entry point.
